><00:00:00.990><c>variance </c><00:00:00.991><c>that </c><00:00:00.992><c>we </c><00:00:00.993><c>had </c><00:00:00.994><c>in </c><00:00:00.995><c>the </c><00:00:00.996><c>original  </c><00:00:00.997><c>model </c><00:00:00.998><c>and </c><00:00:00.999><c>this </c><00:00:01.000><c>makes </c><00:00:01.001><c>sense </c><00:00:01.002><c>in </c><00:00:01.003><c>the  </c><00:00:01.004><c>conditional </c><00:00:01.005><c>model </c><00:00:01.006><c>there </c><00:00:01.007><c>is </c><00:00:01.008><c>less  </c><00:00:01.009><c>uncertainty </c><00:00:01.010><c>than </c><00:00:01.011><c>there </c><00:00:01.012><c>used </c><00:00:01.013><c>to </c><00:00:01.014><c>be </c><00:00:01.015><c>in </c><00:00:01.016><c>the  </c><00:00:01.017><c>original </c><00:00:01.018><c>model </c><00:00:01.019><c>and </c><00:00:01.020><c>this </c><00:00:01.021><c>translates </c><00:00:01.022><c>into  </c><00:00:01.023><c>a </c><00:00:01.024><c>reduction </c><00:00:01.025><c>in </c><00:00:01.026><c>the </c><00:00:01.027><c>variance </c><00:00:01.028><c>to </c><00:00:01.029><c>conclude  </c><00:00:01.030><c>there </c><00:00:01.031><c>is </c><00:00:01.032><c>nothing </c><00:00:01.033><c>really </c><00:00:01.034><c>different </c><00:00:01.035><c>when  </c><00:00:01.036><c>we </c><00:00:01.037><c>deal </c><00:00:01.038><c>with </c><00:00:01.039><c>conditional </c><00:00:01.040><c>pmfs  </c><00:00:01.041><c>conditional </c><00:00:01.042><c>expectations </c><00:00:01.043><c>and </c><00:00:01.044><c>conditional  </c><00:00:01.045><c>variances </c><00:00:01.046><c>they're </c><00:00:01.047><c>just </c><00:00:01.048><c>like </c><00:00:01.049><c>the </c><00:00:01.050><c>ordinary  </c><00:00:01.051><c>pmf's </c><00:00:01.052><c>expectations </c><00:00:01.053><c>and </c><00:00:01.054><c>variances </c><00:00:01.055><c>except  </c><00:00:01.056><c>that </c><00:00:01.057><c>we </c><00:00:01.058><c>have </c><00:00:01.059><c>to </c><00:00:01.060><c>use </c><00:00:01.061><c>the </c><00:00:01.062><c>conditional  </c><00